From ac9b358898b17a8a7592998745a6bd7e1e267fca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Om Kulkarni <kulkarniom7057@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 20:22:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] [SDK] Add missing cstdint include to predicate_factory.h

predicate_factory.h uses uint8_t but does not include cstdint, relying
on a transitive include pulled in elsewhere in the translation unit.
Building this header on its own fails with newer standard library
implementations that no longer provide that transitive include.
---
 CHANGELOG.md                                                | 6 ++++++
 .../opentelemetry/sdk/metrics/view/predicate_factory.h      | 1 +
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 608d6079f7..a757dd8d60 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -18,6 +18,12 @@ Increment the:
 * [API] Remove regex from trace_state.h
   [#4570](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-cpp/pull/4570)
 
+* [SDK] Add a missing `<cstdint>` include to `predicate_factory.h`, which
+  uses `uint8_t` without including the header that declares it. This relied
+  on a transitive include from elsewhere in the translation unit and failed
+  to compile standalone on newer standard library implementations.
+  [#0000](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-cpp/pull/0000)
+
 ## [1.29.0] 2026-09-13
 
 * [RELEASE] Bump main branch to 1.29.0-dev (#4259)
diff --git a/sdk/include/opentelemetry/sdk/metrics/view/predicate_factory.h b/sdk/include/opentelemetry/sdk/metrics/view/predicate_factory.h
index ca7dd4b389..501b69ba93 100644
--- a/sdk/include/opentelemetry/sdk/metrics/view/predicate_factory.h
+++ b/sdk/include/opentelemetry/sdk/metrics/view/predicate_factory.h
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 
 #pragma once
 
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <memory>
 
 #include "opentelemetry/nostd/string_view.h"

